{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Silky Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pixelart action roguelike where you build and upgrade a train, face waves of enemies, and discover what lies at the end of the tracks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter the Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each journey begins in your home station. Plan your route, modify your train layout, and get ready to face whatever the road throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/e116bac38eae37ac09d9adc98828e5f4.poster.avif?t=1753483090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/e116bac38eae37ac09d9adc98828e5f4.webm?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/e116bac38eae37ac09d9adc98828e5f4.mp4?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically arrange unique carts. Some carts attack, some heal, and others generate gold. In every run, you can discover new types and combine them to create your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/d6af6f8a0215154efe8717de5174ffae.poster.avif?t=1753483090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/d6af6f8a0215154efe8717de5174ffae.webm?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Fight to Survive  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your train stops in hostile zones, which are  arenas filled with enemies. Use dynamic weapons, cart abilities, and companions to survive. The longer you stay alive, the stronger your train becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/c72f4c9e6975e0a4c4c8a7e8b7b90bd3.poster.avif?t=1753483090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/c72f4c9e6975e0a4c4c8a7e8b7b90bd3.webm?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/c72f4c9e6975e0a4c4c8a7e8b7b90bd3.mp4?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Unexpected Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll find special rooms with shopkeepers, story characters, or random events. Make choices that shape your path and might even unlock new allies.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/d0e9f816b577c5aebdf49c04d28d8411.poster.avif?t=1753483090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/d0e9f816b577c5aebdf49c04d28d8411.webm?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/d0e9f816b577c5aebdf49c04d28d8411.mp4?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can You Reach the End of the Road?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run pushes deeper into the unknown. Defeat zone bosses, unlock new biomes, and build a train worthy of legend.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you make it back? Will you reach the end of the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist <strong>Silky Road</strong> now and hop aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870990?t=1753483090","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/3af4f49edc08604eb97cb71ce67f36cd363f0ca3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753483090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/d5f8dc17a1686c9e29d3986335593583a7ceb00d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753483090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/d5f8dc17a1686c9e29d3986335593583a7ceb00d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753483090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Silky Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pixelart action roguelike where you build and upgrade a train, face waves of enemies, and discover what lies at the end of the tracks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter the Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each journey begins in your home station. Plan your route, modify your train layout, and get ready to face whatever the road throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/e116bac38eae37ac09d9adc98828e5f4.poster.avif