ted Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll find special rooms with shopkeepers, story characters, or random events. Make choices that shape your path and might even unlock new allies.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/d0e9f816b577c5aebdf49c04d28d8411.poster.avif?t=1753483090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/d0e9f816b577c5aebdf49c04d28d8411.webm?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/d0e9f816b577c5aebdf49c04d28d8411.mp4?t=1753483090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can You Reach the End of the Road?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run pushes deeper into the unknown. Defeat zone bosses, unlock new biomes, and build a train worthy of legend.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you make it back? Will you reach the end of the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist <strong>Silky Road</strong> now and hop aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["JoyDoza"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3