tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/0a351e2268311e25df2c510878e77642faaf7618/ss_0a351e2268311e25df2c510878e77642faaf7618.600x338.jpg?t=1753483090"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/b6fa06863fc03246f3db0136ed488c93ea9a5505/ss_b6fa06863fc03246f3db0136ed488c93ea9a5505.1920x1080.jpg?t=1753483090","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/b6fa06863fc03246f3db0136ed488c93ea9a5505/ss_b6fa06863fc03246f3db0136ed488c93ea9a5505.600x338.jpg?t=1753483090"}],"short_description":"Take on a roguelike adventure along the dangerous Silky Road. Build your train with unique carts, fight tough enemies, and collect new weapons for your character. Each run is full of strange events and deadly zones. Can you make it to the end, or will the Silky Road defeat you like so many before?","steam_appid":3870990,"support_info":{"email":"joydoza.inc@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French","type":"game","website":null}